0..61 Comment "// The circle as a group under rotation, after cubical Agda\'s"
62..137 Comment "// `Cubical/HITs/S1/Base.agda` and `S1/Properties.agda`: the multiplication"
138..216 Comment "// that rotates by the loop and its four inverse laws, every point\'s loop told"
217..287 Comment "// apart from every point\'s reflexivity as functions, and the circle\'s"
288..349 Comment "// universal property, maps out of it as a point with a loop."
350..408 Comment "// `circle-group.gandr` holds the loop space\'s group laws."
409..411 Comment "//"
412..488 Comment "// Out of reach by design: `rotIsEquiv` needs equivalences as structure, and"
489..542 Comment "// `invS¹Equiv` and `invS¹Path` univalence as well."
544..611 Comment "// The empty type, the circle, the integers, every point\'s loop and"
612..660 Comment "// reflexivity, the flip and the multiplication."
661..667 Keyword "import"
668..669 StringLit "\""
669..688 StringLit "./circle-base.gandr"
688..689 StringLit "\""
689..690 Other ";"
691..725 Comment "// The loop is not the empty word."
